# 60. State Machine — Source-Safe Form

The smallest source-safe state machine is:

```text
             ┌───────────────┐
             │   OBSERVING   │
             └───────┬───────┘
                     │
                     ▼
             ┌───────────────┐
             │ CHECK SIGNAL  │
             │   INVARIANT   │
             └───────┬───────┘
                PASS │ FAIL
          ┌──────────┴──────────┐
          ▼                     ▼
      CONTINUE             LOCAL ACTION
                                 │
               ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐
               ▼                 ▼                 ▼
         RE-PACING        LOAD DE-ESCALATE     COOL-DOWN
               │                 │                 │
               └─────────────────┼─────────────────┘
                                 ▼
                         RECOVERY STATE
                         UNKNOWN / GAP
```

